# Claude Code skills installed into each app project's .claude/skills/.
# Format: name | github owner/repo | pinned commit | path to skill dir in repo
# Skills only — plugin hooks are deliberately NOT installed (see docs/skills.md).
# To upgrade: change the commit, then `adx skills apply <app-dir>`.
# To add one: append a line; to drop one: comment it out.

# UI/UX design quality (anti-AI-slop). Web-oriented; apply its principles to Compose.
hallmark       | Nutlope/hallmark              | 407fa689f4a276f2fd389208d271d0fef08f5058 | skills/hallmark

# SwiftUI best practices (iOS). Reference for cross-platform parity / a future iOS template.
swiftui-pro    | twostraws/SwiftUI-Agent-Skill | f2920b63995263f57b3e198674e89a602efba6d2 | swiftui-pro

# Advanced features: autonomous modify -> verify -> keep/discard iteration loops.
autoresearch   | uditgoenka/autoresearch       | 7bddd056dfd0b0ded8360588d8101b1ecb5c0baa | claude-plugin/skills/autoresearch

